You need to know exactly how buyers will pay at checkout—not just what the provider advertises generally.

For HopeStand in Togo, your goal is to offer the local methods your buyers actually use, likely including applicable mobile-money options and possibly cards. PayDunya’s documentation describes T-Money Togo and Moov Togo payment flows, as well as transactions in XOF; however, you must confirm which methods are activated for **your approved account**. 

